<title>CHINA: Trading in First Sign shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in First Sign shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of First Sign International Holdings Ltd was suspended on Monday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.</p>
<p>Shares of First Sign, wholesaler of Montagut-brand clothing in China, fell HK$0.01 to HK$1.65 on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
